{
  "title": { "zh": "检查证明是一次计算" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "第二步：证明也写成数。证明是一棵树，叶子是公理，每个分叉是一次套用，和证明板上接的一样；树也能编成数。检查一个证明只看两件事：每片叶子都在公理表里，每次套用都对得上（「若 A 则 B」接上的正是 A）。公理表里有：下雨、下雨 → 地湿、地湿 → 路滑。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "「A 证得出」于是成了一句关于数的话：有一个数，是通过检查、结论为 A 的证明。记作 Prov(⌜A⌝)。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "gd-check",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms", "codes"],
      "stated": [
        "concl(ax(x)) = x",
        "concl(use(x, y)) = then(concl(x), concl(y))",
        "then(imp(x, y), x) = y",
        "ok(ax(x)) = isax(x)",
        "ok(use(x, y)) = both(both(ok(x), ok(y)), fits(concl(x), concl(y)))",
        "fits(imp(x, y), x) = tt",
        "both(tt, x) = x",
        "isax(rain) = tt",
        "isax(imp(rain, wet)) = tt",
        "isax(imp(wet, slip)) = tt"
      ],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "ok(use(ax(imp(rain, wet)), ax(rain))) = tt" },
        { "goal": "concl(use(ax(imp(rain, wet)), ax(rain))) = wet" },
        { "goal": "ok(use(ax(imp(wet, slip)), use(ax(imp(rain, wet)), ax(rain)))) = tt" },
        { "goal": "concl(use(ax(imp(wet, slip)), use(ax(imp(rain, wet)), ax(rain)))) = slip" }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "十条定义都要用。" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\", \"def.2\", \"def.3\", \"def.4\", \"def.5\", \"def.6\", \"def.7\", \"def.8\", \"def.9\"]]()",
        "c1r0 = refl()",
        "c0 = simp(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
